	(text "Notes:\n- BAT. Vfloat (RFB) is given by 2.5*(1+(R47/R45)) => 2.5*(1+(90.9/10)) = 25.225 (vs. 25.20 in 2026_C_SE_PTS)\n- VOUT min. (RMIN) given by 2.125*(1+(R51/R49)) => 2.125*(1+(${/9b29516b-1745-41d0-bc5f-f6cf48cfb4af/19f231c9-3ea2-4c72-8861-e175feaab368/ec5f26d7-fdd0-48e9-b0a5-29a04a3f71db/77b7c961-89a9-43a2-9149-ac2a1fc6824a:VALUE}/${/9b29516b-1745-41d0-bc5f-f6cf48cfb4af/19f231c9-3ea2-4c72-8861-e175feaab368/ec5f26d7-fdd0-48e9-b0a5-29a04a3f71db/8cc3d687-6aeb-4d45-bf45-972dc6cb4ff7:VALUE})) = 22.14V\n- VOUT max. (RMAX) given by 2.75*(1+(R53/R52)) => 2.75*(1+(${/9b29516b-1745-41d0-bc5f-f6cf48cfb4af/19f231c9-3ea2-4c72-8861-e175feaab368/ec5f26d7-fdd0-48e9-b0a5-29a04a3f71db/2fb51271-e360-42f8-b7f6-562081fe53bd:VALUE}/${/9b29516b-1745-41d0-bc5f-f6cf48cfb4af/19f231c9-3ea2-4c72-8861-e175feaab368/ec5f26d7-fdd0-48e9-b0a5-29a04a3f71db/de63de22-81e2-41cc-92df-f33a6d2de2d3:VALUE})) = 24.75V\n- BAT. max. I (input) set to 5A max. => 0.05/R48 = 0.05/${/9b29516b-1745-41d0-bc5f-f6cf48cfb4af/19f231c9-3ea2-4c72-8861-e175feaab368/ec5f26d7-fdd0-48e9-b0a5-29a04a3f71db/2de7b3e7-36ab-47af-bb5b-dc568f9b8ba8:VALUE} = 4A\n- VIN max. I set to 10A max. (5A BAT. + 5A load) => 0.05/(R3 = R10) = 0.05/0.005 = 10A\n- TIMER set to 3h to charge for safety\n- NTC (BAT. Temp. Monitoring) disabled (floating) (DS p.10)\n- C22 gives a current ramp in 6-7ms"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
